John 2:13 | Chrysostom, Catena Aurea on John (Aquinas): . He did not perform any miracle at Capernaum, the inhabitants of which city were in a very corrupt state, and not well disposed to Him; He went there however, and stayed some time out of respect to H | src: CAJohn.htm#2
