John 2:17 | Origen, Catena Aurea on John (Aquinas): ; It is possible even for the dweller in Jerusalem to incur guilt, and even the most richly endowed may stray. And unless these repent speedily, they lose the capacity wherewith they were endued. He f | src: CAJohn.htm#2
