John 2:25 | Augustine, Catena Aurea on John (Aquinas): . The Maker knew better what was in His own work, than the work knew what was in itself. Peter knew not what was in himself when he said, I will go with You to death; but our Lord’s answer showed that | src: CAJohn.htm#2
