John 3:8 | Augustine, Catena Aurea on John (Aquinas): . As if He said, You understand me to speak of a carnal birth; but a man must be born of water and of the Spirit, if he is to enter into the kingdom of God. If to obtain the temporal inheritance of hi | src: CAJohn.htm#3
