John 3:8 | Haymo, Catena Aurea on John (Aquinas): . But Nicodemus being unable to take in so great and deep mysteries, our Lord helps him by the analogy of our carnal birth, saying, That which is born of the flesh is flesh, and that which is born of  | src: CAJohn.htm#3
