John 5:24 | Gloss, Catena Aurea on John (Aquinas): . Having said that the Son quickens whom He will, He next shows that we attain to life through the Son: Verily, verily, I say to you, He that hears My word, and believes in Him that sent Me, has everl | src: CAJohn.htm#5
